{
  "name": "Spiked Retribution (Path of the Battlerager)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you are wearing spiked armor and a creature touches you (e.g. by grappling you or hitting you with a natural weapon attack) or hits you with a melee attack from within 5 ft, it takes piercing damage equal to your Proficiency bonus. If your armor has a permanent bonus to its armor class (e.g. the masterwork property), you add this bonus to the damage.</p>",
